---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profile, resumeProjects } from '../../data/profile';
import '../../styles/profile.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="完整简历" description="王誉翔的完整网页版简历：AI 产品求职方向、教育与实习经历、四个个人项目及技能荣誉。">
  <article class="profile-page resume-page" id="resume-top">
    <div class="resume-toolbar"><a class="text-link" href={profile.resumePdf}>查看 PDF 简历 ↗</a><button class="resume-print" type="button" data-resume-print>打印 / 保存网页</button></div>
    <header class="profile-heading resume-heading"><p class="eyebrow">CURRICULUM VITAE / 完整简历</p><h1>{profile.name}<span lang="en">{profile.enName}</span></h1><p class="resume-position">{profile.role}</p><div class="resume-contacts"><a href={'tel:+86' + profile.phone}>{profile.phoneDisplay}</a><a href={'mailto:' + profile.email}>{profile.email}</a><span>{profile.language}</span></div><p class="resume-url">作品集：<a href={profile.website}>yuxiangworks.com</a></p></header>
    <nav class="resume-index" aria-label="简历章节"><a href="#education">教育背景</a><a href="#internship">实习经历</a><a href="#practice">项目经历</a><a href="#skills">技能与荣誉</a></nav>
    <section class="resume-section" id="education"><h2><span>01</span> 教育背景</h2>{profile.education.map(item => <article class="resume-entry"><div class="resume-entry-heading"><h3>{item.institution}</h3><p class="profile-date">{item.date}</p></div><p class="profile-meta">{item.degree} · {item.result}</p><p>{item.description}</p></article>)}</section>
    <section class="resume-section" id="internship"><h2><span>02</span> 实习经历</h2>{profile.experience.map(item => <article class="resume-entry"><div class="resume-entry-heading"><h3>{item.institution}</h3><p class="profile-date">{item.date}</p></div><p class="profile-meta">{item.role}</p>{item.projects.map(project => <p><strong>{project.name}：</strong>{project.description}</p>)}</article>)}</section>
    <section class="resume-section" id="practice"><h2><span>03</span> 项目经历</h2>{resumeProjects.map(project => <article class="resume-entry resume-project"><div class="resume-entry-heading"><h3><a href={project.href}>{project.name} ↗</a></h3><p class="profile-date">{project.date}</p></div><p class="profile-meta">{project.en}</p><ul class="resume-points">{project.points.map(point => <li><strong>{point.label}</strong><p>{point.text}</p></li>)}</ul><a class="text-link resume-case-link" href={project.href}>阅读完整项目案例 ↗</a></article>)}</section>
    <section class="resume-section" id="skills"><h2><span>04</span> 专业技能与荣誉</h2><div class="resume-skills">{profile.skills.map(skill => <div><h3>{skill.name}</h3><p>{skill.description}</p></div>)}</div><h3 class="resume-awards-title">精选荣誉</h3><ul class="resume-awards">{profile.awards.map(award => <li>{award.name}{award.detail && `（${award.detail}）`}{award.note && <small>{award.note}</small>}</li>)}</ul></section>
    <footer class="resume-source"><p>内容依据本人《AI 产品方向 · 简历更新版》（{profile.sourceUpdated}）及建筑站现有资料整理。合并版保留样本、分母与未确认事项。</p><div class="profile-links"><a class="text-link" href={profile.resumePdf}>当前 PDF 简历 ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={profile.originalResumePdf}>查看原版 PDF（2026.10.02）↗</a></div><p class="profile-small">网页已补充英伦慢游项目；整份 PDF 简历仍为此前版本。旅行项目的简历补充可在案例页下载。原版 PDF 保留原站网址与原始奖项写法；当前版本采用统一主域，并注明奖项待核对。</p><a class="text-link" href="#resume-top">回到顶部 ↑</a></footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
  document.querySelector('[data-resume-print]')?.addEventListener('click', () => window.print());
</script>
